                "a": "(i) [[√2/5]] + [[3/√6]] = [[3/√6]] + [[√2/5]]\n(ii) [[7/10]] + ([[70/10]] + [[16/33]]) = ([[7/10]] + [[70/10]]) + [[16/33]]\n(iii) 1\n(iv) 1\n(v) 21\n(vi) [[5/8]] × ([[2/3]] + [[5/7]]) = ([[5/8]] × [[2/3]]) + ([[5/8]] × [[5/7]])"
