                "a": "(i) log 3.109 = 0.4926\n(ii) log 310.9 = 2.4926\n(iii) log 0.003109 = 3̅.4926\n(iv) log 3109 = 3.4926\n(v) log 310.942 = 2.4926\n(vi) log 310926 = 5.4926"
