              {
                "q": "هيٺين مساواتن جو حل سيٽ لهو ۽ جوابن جي چڪاس پڻ ڪريو.\nFind the Solution set of the following equations and also verify the answer:\n(i) 6 + √x = 7\n(ii) √(x - 9) = 1\n(iii) √[[y/4]] - 2 = 3\n(iv) √(4x + 5) = √(3x - 7)\n(v) [[√(3y+12)/7]] = 3\n(vi) √x + 9 = 7\n(vii) √(25y−50) = 10√(y+3)\n(viii) √x - 8 = 1\n(ix) 10√(x + 20) = 100",
                "a": "(i) 6 + √x = 7\n√x = 1\nx = 1\n6 + √1 = 7\n{1}\n(ii) √(x - 9) = 1\nx - 9 = 1\nx = 10\n√(10 - 9) = 1\n{10}\n(iii) √[[y/4]] - 2 = 3\n√[[y/4]] = 5\n[[y/4]] = 25\ny = 100\n√[[100/4]] - 2 = 3\n{100}\n(iv) √(4x + 5) = √(3x - 7)\n(√(4x + 5))^2 = (√(3x - 7))^2\n4x + 5 = 3x - 7\nx = -12\n4(-12) + 5 = -43\n-43 < 0\n√(-43) ∉ R\n{}\n(v) [[√(3y+12)/7]] = 3\n√(3y + 12) = 21\n3y + 12 = 441\n3y = 429\ny = 143\n[[√(3(143)+12)/7]] = 3\n{143}\n(vi) √x + 9 = 7\n√x = -2\n√x ≥ 0\n{}\n(vii) √(25y−50) = 10√(y+3)\n(√(25y−50))^2 = (10√(y+3))^2\n25y − 50 = 100(y + 3)\n25y − 50 = 100y + 300\n−350 = 75y\ny = −[[14/3]]\n25(−[[14/3]]) − 50 = −[[500/3]] < 0\n√(−[[500/3]]) ∉ R\n{}\n(viii) √x - 8 = 1\n√x = 9\nx = 81\n√81 - 8 = 1\n{81}\n(ix) 10√(x + 20) = 100\n√(x + 20) = 10\nx + 20 = 100\nx = 80\n10√(80 + 20) = 100\n{80}"
              }
