                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the given quantities:[[/S]][[E]]V = 3 m^3[[/E]][[E]]T = 25°C[[/E]][[E]]T' = 100°C[[/E]][[E]]ΔT = 100 − 25 = 75°C[[/E]][[E]]α = 11 × 10^-6 °C^-1[[/E]][[S]]Find the coefficient of volumetric expansion:[[/S]][[E]]β = 3α = 3 × 11 × 10^-6 = 33 × 10^-6 °C^-1[[/E]][[S]]Write the formula of the change in volume:[[/S]][[E]]ΔV = βVΔT[[/E]][[S]]Put the values:[[/S]][[E]]ΔV = 33 × 10^-6 × 3 × 75[[/E]][[S]]Calculate:[[/S]][[E]]ΔV = 0.007425 m^3[[/E]][[S]]Find the new volume:[[/S]][[E]]V' = V + ΔV = 3 + 0.007425 = 3.007425 m^3[[/E]][[A]]The new volume of the iron block after heating will be 3.007 m^3.[[/A]]"
